cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the journal article (preferred-citation) and the archived software release below."
title: "Uncertainty Quantification Using Conformal Prediction for Mesh-Based Simulations"
abstract: >-
  Code and artifacts for post-hoc split conformal prediction on
  autoregressive surrogate (MeshGraphNet) rollouts for mesh-based physics
  simulations. Implements L2, L-infinity, Mahalanobis, adaptive, and
  component-wise adaptive conformal score functions, and reports empirical
  coverage and prediction-set efficiency under temporal and spatial
  dependence on the CylinderFlow (CFD) and Flag (cloth) datasets.
type: software
